WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.134
"Farmer!" called Farmer's wife.

2
00:00:16.135 --> 00:00:36.161
"Where are you?"

3
00:00:36.162 --> 00:00:40.083
"Uh-oh," said Bat.

4
00:00:40.084 --> 00:00:50.024
Bat flew into the barn.

5
00:00:50.025 --> 00:00:53.352
"Farmer's wife is not happy."

6
00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:56.184
"Why?" asked Cat.

7
00:00:56.185 --> 00:00:59.726
"Farmer is napping," said Bat.

8
00:00:59.727 --> 00:01:03.296
"He is being lazy."

9
00:01:03.297 --> 00:01:06.947
"I am not lazy," called Cow.

10
00:01:06.948 --> 00:01:09.280
"I am busy.

11
00:01:09.281 --> 00:01:17.702
I am busy hooping."

12
00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:20.564
"Wow," said Bat.

13
00:01:20.565 --> 00:01:23.836
"I like your new hula hoop, Cow."

14
00:01:23.837 --> 00:01:27.150
"Me too," said Cat.

15
00:01:27.151 --> 00:01:30.772
"It has pretty sparkles."

16
00:01:30.773 --> 00:01:33.115
"Thank you," said Cow.

17
00:01:33.116 --> 00:01:36.048
"I got it for the contest."

18
00:01:36.049 --> 00:01:38.873
"Contest?" asked Pig.

19
00:01:38.874 --> 00:01:41.605
"What contest?"

20
00:01:41.606 --> 00:01:45.896
"The Hula Hoop contest," said Cow.

21
00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:48.647
"It is at the park.

22
00:01:48.648 --> 00:01:51.706
And I want to win!"

23
00:01:51.707 --> 00:01:57.641
"I think you will win," Bat told Cow.

24
00:01:57.642 --> 00:02:01.624
"You are very good at hooping."

25
00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:04.884
"Thank you," said Cow.

26
00:02:04.885 --> 00:02:07.803
She picked up her hula hoop again.

27
00:02:07.804 --> 00:02:15.768
"Now watch me go!"

